## Requirements

{% if is_gui %}
* A C/C++ compiler and GNU Make
* GTK 4 development headers (`pkg-config --exists gtk4`)
{% else %}
* A C/C++ compiler (`cc`/`g++`) and GNU Make
* Optional: CMake 3.16+
{% endif %}

## Build

```sh
make            # -> build/{{ bin_name }}
make run        # build and run
{% if is_console %}
make test       # build and run the unit tests
{% endif %}
make install    # install into $(PREFIX)/bin (default /usr/local)
make clean
```

Or with CMake:

```sh
cmake -S . -B build && cmake --build build
{% if is_console %}
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
{% endif %}
```

MakeMaker can drive both for you:

```sh
makemaker build .
makemaker run .
```

